event: thinking
data: {"id": "e9924774d32541af-thinking-parallel_evidence-2193", "run_id": "e9924774d32541af", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已获取 kubectl_previous_logs、kubectl_get_yaml、kubectl_describe 三个维度的真实结果。\n\n**事实采集结论**\n1. **容器崩溃原因确认为 OOMKilled**：\n   - `kubectl_get_yaml` 显示容器 `app` 的 `exitCode=137`（对应 SIGKILL）。\n   - `kubectl_describe` 明确指出崩溃原因为 `OOMKilled`。\n2. **应用行为证实存在内存泄漏**：\n   - `kubectl_previous_logs` 显示容器在崩溃前连续执行了 24 次内存分配请求（`memory allocation advanced`）。\n   - 分配的内存从 2 MiB 线性递增至 48 MiB，呈现典型的内存不断增大的泄漏特征。\n3. **状态为 CrashLoopBackOff**：\n   - 容器已重启 14 次，当前处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（`restartPolicy=Always`）。\n\n**候选原因评估：Liveness Probe ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789081244301, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

